- delete Firestore collections
- migrate Firestore structures automatically
- rename existing database fields without explicit instruction
- delete production data
- add destructive database operations
- change Firebase Auth behavior unless required
- change Supabase bucket names unless required
- change storage paths unnecessarily
- change signed URL behavior unless required
- change Firestore Security Rules unless explicitly requested
