# Validation after implementation

After modifying code:

- Check edited files for compile errors.
- Check for obvious regressions.
- Run `dart format` only on files intentionally modified.
- Do not format the entire project unnecessarily.
- Run `flutter analyze` when appropriate.
- Do not fix unrelated analyzer warnings unless explicitly requested.
- Do not claim a feature works unless it was verified through code inspection or testing.
- If an unrelated existing error is found, report it separately instead of changing unrelated code.